617	Qwen-7B & +26.5 & 78.9\% & det-fixed & det wins \\
618	Llama-8B & +30.0 & $>$75\% & det-fixed & det wins \\
619	Qwen-72B & +27.8 & $>$75\% & det-fixed & det wins \\
